    <tags>openlogi logitech hidpp mouse keyboard remap options-plus</tags>
    <summary>A native, local-first alternative to Logitech Options+, written in Rust. Remap buttons, DPI, and SmartShift over HID++.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[A native, local-first alternative to Logitech Options+, written in Rust. Remap buttons, drive DPI and SmartShift, and switch profiles per app, without a Logitech account, telemetry, or the official Options+ install.



**NOTE**: This is an automatically updated package. If you find it is out of date by more than a week, please contact the maintainer(s) and let them know the package is no longer updating correctly.

]]></description>
